# Flameblast Dragon's attack trigger is an AB$ DealDamage with Cost$ X R
# (flameblast_dragon.txt): its target is chosen as it goes on the stack; as it
# resolves its controller agrees to pay, X is announced
# (PlaySpellAbility.announceValuesLikeX, run for the wrapped ability by
# WrappedAbility.java:440) as 2, {2}{R} is paid from three Mountains tapped in
# the declare-attackers step, and the ability deals X = 2 to the AI.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
queue targets ai
declareattackers
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue optionaltrigger true
queue payx 2
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
resolvestack
